        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$P(A)=2p-p^2$.\n\nUse the complement: neither inherited gene is pink.",
          "worked": "The complement of $A$ is receiving no pink gene. The two selections are independent, so $P(\\overline A)=(1-p)^2$.\n$$\\begin{align*}P(A)&=1-P(\\overline A)\\\\P(A)&=1-(1-p)^2\\\\P(A)&=2p-p^2\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 44
      },
      {
        "id": "p40-q28-b",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "b",
        "prompt": {
          "format": "maths-editor-document-v1",
          "version": 1,
          "blocks": [
            {
              "id": "p40-q28-b-instruction",
              "type": "paragraph",
              "fontSize": null,
              "align": "left",
              "spaceBefore": 0,
              "spaceAfter": 2,
              "lineHeight": 1.4,
              "indent": 0,
              "inlines": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "Show that ",
                  "marks": []
                },
                {
                  "type": "math",
                  "latex": "P(B)=2pq+2pr+2qr",
                  "display": false
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": ".",
                  "marks": []
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$P(B)=2pq+2pr+2qr$.\n\nAdd the probabilities of the six different-colour ordered pairs.",
          "worked": "The striped outcomes are $PQ,QP,PR,RP,QR,RQ$. These outcomes are disjoint, and the gene selections are independent.\n$$\\begin{align*}P(B)&=pq+qp+pr+rp+qr+rq\\\\P(B)&=2pq+2pr+2qr\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 36
      },
